@startuml
title Diagrama de Implantação · Sistema de Moeda Estudantil na Railway

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 90
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #FEFEFE
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam storage {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #FBFBFB
  BorderColor #777777
}

node "Computador ou celular do usuário" <<device>> as Dispositivo {
  node "Navegador web" <<execution environment>> as Navegador {
    artifact "Aplicação React (SPA)" as Spa
  }
}

cloud "Railway · projeto grateful-tranquility · ambiente production" as Railway {

  node "Serviço frontend" <<container>> as ServicoFront {
    node "Node.js 22" <<execution environment>> as NodeFront {
      artifact "serve" as Serve
      artifact "dist/\n(build do Vite)" as Dist
    }
  }

  node "Serviço api" <<container>> as ServicoApi {
    node "Node.js 22" <<execution environment>> as NodeApi {
      artifact "API Express\n(dist/index.js)" as Api
    }
    storage "Volume /data\n(fotos das vantagens)" as VolumeApi
  }

  node "Serviço Postgres" <<container>> as ServicoBanco {
    database "PostgreSQL 18\n(banco railway)" as Banco
    storage "Volume\n/var/lib/postgresql/data" as VolumeBanco
  }
}

node "GitHub\nbrunokilo/lab03-projetoSoftware" <<repositório>> as GitHub
node "ViaCEP" <<serviço externo>> as ViaCep
node "Servidor de e-mail\n(SMTP / Ethereal)" <<serviço externo>> as Email

Serve ..> Dist : serve os arquivos

Navegador --> ServicoFront : HTTPS, baixa a aplicação\nfrontend-production-5448b8f4.up.railway.app
Navegador --> ServicoApi : HTTPS + JSON, token JWT\nlab03-projetosoftware-production.up.railway.app
Navegador --> ViaCep : HTTPS\nconsulta de CEP

Api --> Banco : TCP 5432, rede privada\npostgres.railway.internal
Api --> VolumeApi : grava e lê as fotos
Banco --> VolumeBanco : dados
Api .down.> Email : SMTP\n(bloqueado pela Railway no plano atual)

GitHub .up.> ServicoFront : build Railpack a cada push na main\n(pasta /frontend)
GitHub .up.> ServicoApi : build Railpack a cada push na main\n(pasta /backend)
@enduml
